        <h1>Create a Course</h1>
        <p>This is the page for learing how to create a new course in the Course Grade Calculator.</p>
        <br>
        <p>To create a new course, follow these steps:</p>
        <ol>
            <li>Click on the "Add Course" button on the main page.</li>
            <img src="/images/LandingPage.png" alt="Landing Page of the Course Grade Calculator" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin-top: 20px;">
            <li>It will take you to the course creation form.</li>
            <img src="/images/CreateCourse.png" alt="Create Course Page of the Course Grade Calculator" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin-top: 20px;">
            <li>You will need to make sure a Course has a Name, Code, and Semester.</li>
            <li>You will then need to create a Subsection with a name and weight. The Max and Dropped Grades must be greater than or equal to 0.</li>
            <li>You must have at least one Subsection. All subsections weights must equal 100% exactly.</li>
            <li>Click "Submit" to create the course.</li>
        </ol>
        <p>Once the course is created, you will be redirected to the main page where you can see the newly created course.</p>
    </div>
